{"id":"wb-7-1058","name":"九华山月身殿","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T13:25:15+00:00","status":"ready","title":"肉身寶殿","text":"肉身殿，又称月身宝殿、老爷顶，位于安徽九华山神光岭。殿内藏有金地藏的肉身舍利，为汉族地区佛教全国重点寺院。\n肉身宝殿不是像中国传统寺庙那样坐北朝南，而是面向金地藏家乡韩国，坐南朝北。宝殿前立有华表，象征其新罗王子的尊贵地位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%82%89%E8%BA%AB%E5%AF%B6%E6%AE%BF","revisionId":86555335,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86555335","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"复核名称、所在地与对应遗址；原名录行政地址及参考点位不作为唯一判断依据","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/f685e50359e82b96293a7bb7.jpg","title":"Roushen_Temple.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Roushen_Temple.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/1a/Roushen_Temple.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"钉钉","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​金地藏肉身殿，月身宝殿，老爷顶","width":320,"height":180,"matchEvidence":"已复核文物对应百科条目的主图","subject":"肉身寶殿"}}